{
  "parse": {
    "title": "Ancient Pig",
    "pageid": 79326,
    "revid": 860221,
    "text": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"messagebox boxcol-red\" style=\"\">\n<div class=\"messagebox-main\">\n<div class=\"messagebox-image nomobile\" style=\"\">\n<p><span class=\"notpageimage\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/File:Historic_content.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/Historic_content.png/50px-Historic_content.png?25766\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Historic_content.png/100px-Historic_content.png?25766 2x\" data-file-width=\"160\" data-file-height=\"160\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"messagebox-text\" style=\"\">\n<p><b>Ancient Pig</b> was significantly altered or removed after an update. This article is retained for historical purposes.\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"messagebox-aside\">\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"infobox\"><div class=\"infobox-title\">Ancient Pig</div><div class=\"infobox-panel\"><ul class=\"infobox-section-labels\"><li class=\"label-active\" style=\"display:none\"></li></ul><div class=\"section active\"><div class=\"infobox-row-container\"><div class=\"infobox-row-value\">\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span><span class=\"mw-default-size pi-image-thumbnail\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/File:Pig_(Temperate).png\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"Ancient Pig.png\"><img alt=\"Ancient Pig.png\" src=\"/images/Pig_%28Temperate%29.png?f7ca9\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"512\" height=\"475\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"512\" data-file-height=\"475\" /></a></span></span></div></div></div><div class=\"infobox-row-container\"><div class=\"infobox-row-label\">Type</div><div class=\"infobox-row-value\">\n<a href=\"/w/NPC\" title=\"NPC\">NPC</a></div></div></div></div></div>\n<p>The <b>Ancient Pig</b> was an <a href=\"/w/NPC\" title=\"NPC\">NPC</a> in the <a href=\"/w/Hub\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Hub\"><span class=\"hsw-gamefont\"><span class=\"color-gray\" style=\"\">&#xe067; </span></span><span class=\"light-color color-aqua\" style=\"\">Hub</span></a> that was summoned when all 7 <span class=\"spriteicon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/Shiny_Relic\" title=\"Shiny Relic\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/Shiny_Relic.png/21px-Shiny_Relic.png?df26d\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"21\" height=\"21\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Shiny_Relic.png/42px-Shiny_Relic.png?df26d 2x\" data-file-width=\"300\" data-file-height=\"300\" /></a></span>&#160;<a href=\"/w/Shiny_Relic\" title=\"Shiny Relic\">Shiny Relics</a> were found. The shrine for the <b>Ancient Pig</b> could be found in the <a href=\"/w/Hub\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Hub\"><span class=\"hsw-gamefont\"><span class=\"color-gray\" style=\"\">&#xe067; </span></span><span class=\"light-color color-aqua\" style=\"\">Hub</span></a> after <span class=\"spriteicon notpageimage\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/Technoblade\" title=\"Technoblade\"><img alt=\"A sprite icon representing Technoblade in Hypixel SkyBlock\" src=\"/images/thumb/Technoblade_Sprite.png/16px-Technoblade_Sprite.png?4e49f\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"16\" height=\"15\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Technoblade_Sprite.png/32px-Technoblade_Sprite.png?4e49f 2x\" data-file-width=\"288\" data-file-height=\"272\" /></a></span> <a href=\"/w/Technoblade\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Technoblade\">Technoblade</a> became mayor, as it was his second perk.\n</p><p>When a <span class=\"spriteicon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/Shiny_Relic\" title=\"Shiny Relic\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/Shiny_Relic.png/21px-Shiny_Relic.png?df26d\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"21\" height=\"21\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Shiny_Relic.png/42px-Shiny_Relic.png?df26d 2x\" data-file-width=\"300\" data-file-height=\"300\" /></a></span>&#160;<a href=\"/w/Shiny_Relic\" title=\"Shiny Relic\">Shiny Relic</a> was found it automatically went and hovered by the <a href=\"/w/Blood_God_Shrine\" title=\"Blood God Shrine\">Blood God Shrine</a> and gave a copy of the relic to the player who found it. When all seven were collected, it summoned the <b>Ancient Pig</b>, giving various special buffs to players.\n</p><p>Upon the player's first click on the <b>Ancient Pig</b>, it started dialogue and opened a menu granting a <span class=\"spriteicon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/Flying_Pig\" title=\"Flying Pig\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/Enchanted_Feather.png/21px-Enchanted_Feather.png?a47eb\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"21\" height=\"21\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Enchanted_Feather.png/42px-Enchanted_Feather.png?a47eb 2x\" data-file-width=\"160\" data-file-height=\"160\" /></a></span>&#160;<a href=\"/w/Flying_Pig\" title=\"Flying Pig\">Flying Pig</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Found_Shiny_Relics\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Found Shiny Relics</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Ancient_Pig_Effects\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Ancient Pig Effects</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Dialogue\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Dialogue</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Trivia\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Trivia</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#History\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">History</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Navigation\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Navigation</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Found_Shiny_Relics\">Found Shiny Relics</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/Ancient_Pig?section=1&amp;veaction=edit\" title=\"Edit section: Found Shiny Relics\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/Ancient_Pig?action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section&#039;s source code: Found Shiny Relics\"><span>edit source</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote navigation-not-searchable\">Main article: <a href=\"/w/Shiny_Relic\" title=\"Shiny Relic\">Shiny Relic</a></div>\n<table class=\"wikitable\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Relic #\n</th>\n<th>Found By\n</th>\n<th>Date Found\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td>carten7\n</td>\n<td>April 17, 2021\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>niszczyciel149\n</td>\n<td>April 18, 2021\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>The_Blood_Angel\n</td>\n<td>April 21, 2021\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>JCRobertson\n</td>\n<td>April 24, 2021\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>5\n</td>\n<td>Jimmicim\n</td>\n<td>April 29, 2021\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>6\n</td>\n<td>lzyy_\n</td>\n<td>April 30, 2021\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>7\n</td>\n<td>MrLopaiz\n</td>\n<td>May 7, 2021\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Ancient_Pig_Effects\">Ancient Pig Effects</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/Ancient_Pig?section=2&amp;veaction=edit\" title=\"Edit section: Ancient Pig Effects\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/Ancient_Pig?action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section&#039;s source code: Ancient Pig Effects\"><span>edit source</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<p>After the 7 <span class=\"spriteicon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/Shiny_Relic\" title=\"Shiny Relic\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/Shiny_Relic.png/21px-Shiny_Relic.png?df26d\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"21\" height=\"21\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Shiny_Relic.png/42px-Shiny_Relic.png?df26d 2x\" data-file-width=\"300\" data-file-height=\"300\" /></a></span>&#160;<a href=\"/w/Shiny_Relic\" title=\"Shiny Relic\">Shiny Relics</a> were found, the <b>Ancient Pig</b> spawned, floating over the <a href=\"/w/Blood_God_Shrine\" title=\"Blood God Shrine\">Blood God Shrine</a>. The <b>Ancient Pig</b> granted a game-wide effect every <a href=\"/w/SkyBlock_Day\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"SkyBlock Day\">SkyBlock Day</a> to players, for two real-life days time. Effects could be repeated, indicating that the effect selection was at mostly random.\n</p><p>When a new effect was selected, a full-screen message appeared for all players alerting them that a new effect was being selected. This was followed by a random-wheel like selection of the next effect. Once it was selected, a chat alert was sent out, notifying all players.\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Condition\n</th>\n<th>Dialogue\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"ct\">New effect selected\n</td>\n<td><div class=\"mcdialogue\" style=\"\"><div class=\"mcdialogue-line\"><span class=\"format-d\"><span class=\"format-l\">[PIG SHRINE] </span></span><span class=\"format-e\">The </span><span class=\"format-6\">&lt;effect title&gt; </span><span class=\"format-e\">shrine buff is now active! &lt;effect description&gt;</span></div></div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"ct\">Possible effects\n</td>\n<td><div class=\"mcdialogue\" style=\"\"><div class=\"mcdialogue-line\"><span class=\"format-6\"><span class=\"format-l\">Fairy Soul Infusion </span></span><span class=\"format-e\">Buff stats by 50% for </span><span class=\"format-b\">60s </span><span class=\"format-e\">every time a fairy soul is clicked!</span></div><div class=\"mcdialogue-line\"><span class=\"format-6\"><span class=\"format-l\">Thunder </span></span><span class=\"format-e\">A storm has begun bringing along some rare empowered creatures!</span></div><div class=\"mcdialogue-line\"><span class=\"format-6\"><span class=\"format-l\">Double Mob Drops </span></span><span class=\"format-e\">All drops from mobs are doubled!</span></div><div class=\"mcdialogue-line\"><span class=\"format-6\"><span class=\"format-l\">Double Pet Stats </span></span><span class=\"format-e\">All stats received from pets are doubled!</span></div><div class=\"mcdialogue-line\"><span class=\"format-6\"><span class=\"format-l\">Increased Runic Chance </span></span><span class=\"format-e\">Increased the chance for runic monsters to spawn by </span><span class=\"format-b\">5x</span><span class=\"format-e\">!</span></div><div class=\"mcdialogue-line\"><span class=\"format-6\"><span class=\"format-l\">Mining Experience </span></span><span class=\"format-e\">Increased Mining experience earned by </span><span class=\"format-b\">+25%</span><span class=\"format-e\">!</span></div><div class=\"mcdialogue-line\"><span class=\"format-6\"><span class=\"format-l\">Foraging Experience </span></span><span class=\"format-e\">Increased Foraging experience earned by </span><span class=\"format-b\">+25%</span><span class=\"format-e\">!</span></div><div class=\"mcdialogue-line\"><span class=\"format-6\"><span class=\"format-l\">Farming Experience </span></span><span class=\"format-e\">Increased Farming experience earned by </span><span class=\"format-b\">+25%</span><span class=\"format-e\">!</span></div><div class=\"mcdialogue-line\"><span class=\"format-6\"><span class=\"format-l\">Fishing Experience </span></span><span class=\"format-e\">Increased Fishing experience earned by </span><span class=\"format-b\">+25%</span><span class=\"format-e\">!</span></div><div class=\"mcdialogue-line\"><span class=\"format-6\"><span class=\"format-l\">Combat Experience </span></span><span class=\"format-e\">Increased Combat experience earned by </span><span class=\"format-b\">+25%</span><span class=\"format-e\">!</span></div></div>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Dialogue\">Dialogue</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/Ancient_Pig?section=3&amp;veaction=edit\" title=\"Edit section: Dialogue\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/Ancient_Pig?action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section&#039;s source code: Dialogue\"><span>edit source</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<table class=\"wikitable\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Condition\n</th>\n<th>Dialogue\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"ct\">None\n</td>\n<td><div class=\"mcdialogue\" style=\"\"><div class=\"mcdialogue-line\"><span class=\"format-e\">[NPC] </span><span class=\"format-6\">Ancient Pig</span><span class=\"format-f\">: The </span><span class=\"format-d\">7</span><span class=\"format-f\"> Pig Relics have been found, therefore I am.</span></div><div class=\"mcdialogue-line\"><span class=\"format-e\">[NPC] </span><span class=\"format-6\">Ancient Pig</span><span class=\"format-f\">: People call me the Ancient Pig, and I bring good fortune in the land.</span></div><div class=\"mcdialogue-line\"><span class=\"format-e\">[NPC] </span><span class=\"format-6\">Ancient Pig</span><span class=\"format-f\">: A random effect will appear every </span><span class=\"format-b\">20</span><span class=\"format-f\"> minutes for the next </span><span class=\"format-b\">2 days</span><span class=\"format-f\">.</span></div><div class=\"mcdialogue-line\"><span class=\"format-e\">[NPC] </span><span class=\"format-6\">Ancient Pig</span><span class=\"format-f\">: The current effect is </span><span class=\"format-6\">&lt;current effect&gt;</span><span class=\"format-f\">.</span></div></div>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/Ancient_Pig?section=4&amp;veaction=edit\" title=\"Edit section: Trivia\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/Ancient_Pig?action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section&#039;s source code: Trivia\"><span>edit source</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<ul><li><b>Thunder</b>'s effect wasn't very specific. It made every island rain, spawning <span class=\"spriteicon notpageimage\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/Skeleton_Horse\" title=\"Skeleton Horse\"><img alt=\"A sprite icon representing Skeleton Horse in Hypixel SkyBlock\" src=\"/images/thumb/Skeleton_Horse_Sprite.png/16px-Skeleton_Horse_Sprite.png?90954\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"16\" height=\"21\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Skeleton_Horse_Sprite.png/32px-Skeleton_Horse_Sprite.png?90954 2x\" data-file-width=\"197\" data-file-height=\"258\" /></a></span> <a href=\"/w/Skeleton_Horse\" title=\"Skeleton Horse\">Skeleton Horses</a> and <span class=\"spriteicon notpageimage\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/Charged_Creeper\" title=\"Charged Creeper\"><img alt=\"A sprite icon representing Charged Creeper in Hypixel SkyBlock\" src=\"/images/thumb/Creeper_%28charged%29_%28static%29_Sprite.png/16px-Creeper_%28charged%29_%28static%29_Sprite.png?48d90\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Creeper_%28charged%29_%28static%29_Sprite.png/32px-Creeper_%28charged%29_%28static%29_Sprite.png?48d90 2x\" data-file-width=\"288\" data-file-height=\"288\" /></a></span> <a href=\"/w/Charged_Creeper\" title=\"Charged Creeper\">Charged Creepers</a>.</li></ul>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"History\">History</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/Ancient_Pig?section=5&amp;veaction=edit\" title=\"Edit section: History\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/Ancient_Pig?action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section&#039;s source code: History\"><span>edit source</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<table class=\"wikitable pixelated\" data-description=\"History\"><tbody><tr><th colspan=\"3\"><a href=\"/w/SkyBlock_Prototype\" title=\"SkyBlock Prototype\">SkyBlock Prototype</a></th></tr><tr><th rowspan=\"1\" colspan=\"2\">Apr&#160;16,&#160;2021</th><td>Added the <a href=\"/w/Blood_God_Shrine\" title=\"Blood God Shrine\">Blood God Shrine</a>.</td></tr>\n<tr><th rowspan=\"1\" colspan=\"2\">May&#160;7,&#160;2021</th><td>The 7th <span class=\"spriteicon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/Shiny_Relic\" title=\"Shiny Relic\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/Shiny_Relic.png/21px-Shiny_Relic.png?df26d\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"21\" height=\"21\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Shiny_Relic.png/42px-Shiny_Relic.png?df26d 2x\" data-file-width=\"300\" data-file-height=\"300\" /></a></span>&#160;<a href=\"/w/Shiny_Relic\" title=\"Shiny Relic\">Shiny Relic</a> was found, spawning the <b>Ancient Pig</b>.</td></tr>\n<tr><th rowspan=\"1\" colspan=\"2\">May&#160;8,&#160;2021</th><td>Nerfed <span class=\"hsw-gamefont\" style=\"color: #FF9000;\">Fairy Soul Infusion</span> from a <span class=\"light-color color-green\">100%</span> stat increase to <span class=\"light-color color-green\">50%</span>.</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-hea